                        "target_lang_word": "Oboe",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Oboe",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ccb35da-0362-3806-a55c-0347b5d878dc",
                                        "entry_id": "ad803eaa-66d7-398a-acd2-e635b471f0b7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Holzblasinstrument mit Doppelrohrblatt"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Musik"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d76af092-7041-49e5-a8d1-487fc8363c2b",
                                                "sense_id": "4ccb35da-0362-3806-a55c-0347b5d878dc",
                                                "text": "Die Oboe wird im Orchester eingesetzt."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ba4012bb-c753-4b56-b621-28cc207fe271",
                                                "sense_id": "4ccb35da-0362-3806-a55c-0347b5d878dc",
                                                "text": "„Wegen ihrer Herkunft von der Schalmei wird die Oboe auch jetzt noch für die Schilderung des pastoralen Lebens geeignet empfunden.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "a5f51041-1475-4e07-b734-5bae8b4a9e74",
                        "source_entry_id": "58f40402-9314-322c-b5d0-c8c9d33f3ac3",
                        "source_sense_id": "a84d186a-c25b-3f44-a760-052d83603c3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "orkestinstrument, behoort tot de houtblazers, het wordt met een dubbelriet aangeblazen",
                        "target_lang_word": "oboe",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "oboe",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "108a39d5-24b8-31c0-9927-4484b47eaef4",
                                        "entry_id": "35be3674-f5a6-31a9-88c4-a6a26f3859c4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A soprano and melody wind instrument in the modern orchestra and wind ensemble. It is a smaller instrument and generally made of grenadilla wood. It is a member of the double reed family."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "91cb6b63-1d45-4a1f-a9ff-8972dba4b95f",
                                                "sense_id": "108a39d5-24b8-31c0-9927-4484b47eaef4",
                                                "text": "Whistles, mirlitons, flutes, trumpets or horns, clarinets, and oboes are all played in one or more parts of the continent."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ea783aa7-3e0f-458a-afca-c261539ff13c",
                                                "sense_id": "108a39d5-24b8-31c0-9927-4484b47eaef4",
                                                "text": "This does become monstrously antimusical in one scene: when Tchaikovsky’s music, softly depicting the sleeping palace (my favorite passage of this composer’s entire oeuvre, with its beautifully muffled oboe melody suggesting how beauty ripens in sleep like a chrysalis), is turned into an epic battle for the poor passive Prince, conducted between the wicked Carabosse, with her ghoulish minions, and the Lilac Fairy, with her elves."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac3b7d4c-0f19-4f38-b47b-d8ee57e8ab1d",
                                                "sense_id": "108a39d5-24b8-31c0-9927-4484b47eaef4",
                                                "text": "Using the “endangered species” model employed by the World Wide Fund for Nature, campaigners are highlighting the scarcity of bassoonists and paving the way for the promotion of some other orchestral instruments that are under threat, such as the oboe, French horn, viola, trombone and double bass."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c16a6bb3-a3f0-483c-99d1-9f3fd4d3e38b",
                        "source_entry_id": "58f40402-9314-322c-b5d0-c8c9d33f3ac3",
                        "source_sense_id": "a84d186a-c25b-3f44-a760-052d83603c3f",
                        "source_sense_description": "orkestinstrument, behoort tot de houtblazers, het wordt met een dubbelriet aangeblazen",
                        "target_lang_word": "hautbois",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "hautbois",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fb832aad-df30-31e6-8579-7ffb0f6689d4",
                                        "entry_id": "7253d4db-1087-35bb-90e3-841aadad8fc6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Instrument à vent, de perce conique et à anche double, de sonorités très variées (puissant et sonore ou doux et charmeur, clair et nasillard ou plein de rondeur et de chaleur)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e7e581a0-fdf2-4c75-856e-ed9b00c0e72b",
                                                "sense_id": "fb832aad-df30-31e6-8579-7ffb0f6689d4",
                                                "text": "Vous entendez les hautbois ? Ils jouent le prélude de Lohengrin et se répondent d'une tour à l'autre de mon château."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f27af886-1bd1-4929-bf4a-9eebc213e3fa",
                                                "sense_id": "fb832aad-df30-31e6-8579-7ffb0f6689d4",
                                                "text": "Le hautbois, c’est l’arrière petit-fils du chalumeau des églogues."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "80a2423c-686c-4935-9761-a177c1c5ce3f",
                                                "sense_id": "fb832aad-df30-31e6-8579-7ffb0f6689d4",
                                                "text": "Et ce souffle s’affine, il s’allège, il est doux et pénétrant comme le son d’un hautbois."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2eedf7b7-91e5-34a2-a5a4-92f2f064a3c7",
                                        "entry_id": "7253d4db-1087-35bb-90e3-841aadad8fc6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Celui qui joue du hautbois."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "metonymically"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6f180313-2449-44e7-b7c7-32937873ee6f",
                                                "sense_id": "2eedf7b7-91e5-34a2-a5a4-92f2f064a3c7",
                                                "text": "Premier prix du Concours international \"Gillet\" (USA-1999) et du Concours international de Tokyo (2000), [Alexandre Gattet] participe à de nombreux festivals en France et à l’étranger et a été invité comme hautbois solo au sein de grands orchestres internationaux (Philharmonique de Berlin, Orchestre de la Radio bavaroise, Budapest Festival Orchestra, Mahler Chamber Orchestra…).\n Il prend ses fonctions en qualité de premier hautbois solo à l’Orchestre de Paris en 2001. En 2002, il est lauréat du prestigieux concours de l’ARD à Munich."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7cd731a4-d7bd-397e-b44a-5cc81fe92d44",
                                        "entry_id": "7253d4db-1087-35bb-90e3-841aadad8fc6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Des jeux de l’orgue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
